<TextPage title="Model comparisons" description="Curated model-versus-model pages will publish only when both models have current live results." noindex={true}>
  <div class="empty-state"><strong>No thin comparison pages.</strong><p>Pair pages are generated only after both models pass the same benchmark version and an editor writes a decision-specific verdict.</p></div>
  <h2>Required comparison evidence</h2>
  <ul><li>Same benchmark version and comparable provider routes.</li><li>Roleplay, memory, lawful adult reliability, safety, privacy, cost, and speed.</li><li>A direct answer for each user job rather than one universal winner.</li><li>Clear disclosure of stale or missing evidence.</li></ul>
</TextPage>
